# Third-party notices for The Storm plugin

## CraftBook (EngineHub)

The mechanics module's `IntegratedCircuits`, `FarmCircuits`, `CropCircuits`,
`ItemCircuits`, `AnimalCircuits`, `CircuitAccess`, `CircuitGrowth` and IC domain
types port the logic, pin layout, clock and farm behavior of CraftBook at
revision 02d48ae35355c576382ed108ef65ca885e83f21c.
Upstream: https://github.com/EngineHub/CraftBook/tree/02d48ae35355c576382ed108ef65ca885e83f21c
The original copyright and GNU GPL version 3-or-later header is retained in
the ported adapter. `FamilySISO`, `Family3ISO`, `ICUtil`, `Clock`, `Inverter`,
`AndGate`, `WirelessTransmitter` and `WirelessReceiver` define the behavior.
The full license is bundled as `META-INF/licenses/CraftBook-GPL-3.0.txt`.
The farm ports follow the corresponding original world IC implementations,
including the contributors Drathus, Me4502 and the CraftBook project.

## minecraft-data (PrismarineJS)

`plugin/core/src/main/resources/legacy-items.csv` derives the numeric Minecraft
item mappings from minecraft-data 3.117.0's `data/pc/common/legacy.json`.
Six subsequently renamed vanilla item names are updated to the current names.
